The cabinet's colophon credits "Messrs. Horrocks & Claude." That is a
pleasantry, not a claim of joint copyright: the work was devised and directed
by Christopher Horrocks and built with Claude (Anthropic) as an instrument.
Rights are held by the human author named above.
